## 🚀 Program Overview

**Duration**: 8 Weeks (May 5 - November 5, 2025)  
**Partners**: Unified HR Consulting & MC Studio  
**Focus**: IBM Advanced Technology Training & Certification  
**Cohort Size**: 50 Participants  

### 📋 Training Phases

| Phase | Duration | Focus Area | Key Deliverables |
|-------|----------|------------|------------------|
| **Foundation** | Weeks 1-2 | IBM Ecosystem Mastery | Cloud Foundations, Solutions Portfolio |
| **Specialization** | Weeks 3-6 | Watson Technical & Sales | 4 Watson Badges + Sales Certification |
| **Deployment** | Weeks 7-8 | Real-World Application | TechZone & DSCE Portal Projects |

## 🎯 Learning Objectives

- **Master IBM Cloud Architecture** and deployment strategies
- **Earn Watson AI Certifications** in Assistant, Discovery, ML, and Sales
- **Build Production-Ready Solutions** using IBM technologies
- **Develop Professional Portfolio** with real-world projects
- **Achieve Industry Placement** with IBM partner companies

